    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52403" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰκουχ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrong, injure</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὑτόν</span> Teles<i><span class="en">
				p.34H.
			</span></i>; <i>maltreat</i>, esp. a wife, Mitteis<i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				284.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				281.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>, etc.:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be afflicted</i> or <i>injured</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ δηγμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακουχουμένους τελευτῆσαι τὸν βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.114e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
